Project  𝄀
  ->  Aggregate  𝄀
        Aggregate Functions: sum(serial_extract(__mo_index_idx_col, 1, INT)))  𝄀
        ->  Index Table Scan on t.ix_ab  𝄀
              Filter Cond: prefix_in_range(__mo_index_idx_col), (serial_extract(__mo_index_idx_col, 1, INT)) > 5)  𝄀
              Block Filter Cond: prefix_in_range(__mo_index_idx_col)
